<title>UK: Britain's oldest man dies at 109.</title>
<headline>Britain's oldest man dies at 109.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's oldest man, former train driver Vincent Gulliver, has died at the age of 109, his daughter said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Gulliver, one of 13 children, was born in the year that Queen Victoria celebrated her golden jubilee. He had one recipe for longevity -- he enjoyed a tot every day of whisky mixed with orange and honey.</p>
